// One brand, whatever door it sits behind: what it is called, what it is drawn
// in, and how it is reached. A place imports this and adds what its own door
// decides — the trade line, the phone, how many of each to print.
//
// The monogram is `name`'s first letter, so a logo is nothing to keep here.
// `primary` fills the card's front and carries white type, so it has to be dark;
// leave it and `accent` out and every door takes the pair `typ/__main__.typ`
// names.

